thunderbolt: reset TB3 links at shutdown (7.3)

Mainline's, in 7.3, for 7.2, which lacks it:

5f40cba7d4fa thunderbolt: Assert downstream port reset on shutdown

Its nhi.c context comes from before 7.2-rc7, where a nearby line sat
elsewhere, so that hunk is moved onto 7.2's; the code is mainline's.

diff --git a/drivers/thunderbolt/nhi.c b/drivers/thunderbolt/nhi.c
index 35e3c119d5ee..383a36212f70 100644
--- a/drivers/thunderbolt/nhi.c
+++ b/drivers/thunderbolt/nhi.c
@@ -1235,6 +1235,8 @@ int nhi_probe(struct tb_nhi *nhi)
 
 	dev_dbg(dev, "NHI initialized, starting thunderbolt\n");
 
+	nhi->host_reset = host_reset;
+
 	res = tb_domain_add(tb, host_reset);
 	if (res) {
 		/*
